  "details": "Why would vrchat need this:\n\nFor information of what happening in the world, event rules or maybe even a birthday celebration.\n\nThe event sign can have a message or even allow placing a single sticker on it, let's say you go to a world where there's an event where someone is playing the piano, and you see a sign that says please be respectful no talking during the event and you like alright. \n\nOr like I said there's a sign to announce someone's birthday \n\nI feel this would be a great small quality life for Vrchat\n\nThank you for reading.",
